- actor(a_default, "Default", [i1, n1, n2, n3, n4, n5, e1, c1, b1]): Assigns all activities to "Default", contradicting the source which explicitly attributes responsibilities to resellers ("For resellers...", "they need to complete...", "they should then receive...").
- action(n5, "end process"): Hallucinates a discrete process step not present in the description; the text simply states "the process comes to an end" immediately upon completion, which should map directly to end(e1).
- label(n3, c1, "after all steps completed") and label(n4, c1, "after all steps completed"): Incorrectly asserts that all concurrent steps are finished upon exiting individual branches; the source specifies that collective completion ("Once these steps are completed") occurs at the convergence point, not beforehand.